---
ogImage: /img/og/og-home.png
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: "Anton Stasiuk — Frontend Developer"
description: "Frontend developer in Minsk. Vue, Nuxt, React, TypeScript. Three years of commercial work: marketplaces, e-commerce, PWAs."
altUrl: /
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="l-container">
    <p class="hero__kicker">Frontend Developer · Minsk</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Anton Stasiuk</h1>
    <p class="hero__lead">
      Three years in production. Vue, Nuxt, React. I build interfaces that open fast
      and do not fall apart a year later.
    </p>
    <p class="hero__meta">
      <span>React / Vue / TypeScript</span>
      <span>remote or hybrid</span>
      <span>open to opportunities</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="l-section" id="work">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-head__index">01</span>
      <h2 class="section-head__title">Selected work</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="work-list">
      {% for work in en.works %}
      <a class="work-item" href="/en/work/{{ work.slug }}/">
        <span class="work-item__title">{{ work.title }}</span>
        <span class="work-item__period">{{ work.period }}</span>
        <span class="work-item__desc">{{ work.subtitle }}. {{ work.desc }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="l-section" id="contact">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-head__index">02</span>
      <h2 class="section-head__title">Get in touch</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__lead">
      Telegram is the fastest way to reach me. Need a PDF version? I will put one together.
    </p>
    <ul class="contact-list">
      <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.telegram }}" rel="noopener">@AntonStasiuk</a></li>
      <li><a href="{{ site.github }}" rel="noopener">github.com/11Alone11</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
